      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "A 2D cartoon character, seen from the side, stands firmly in place facing screen-left and attacks something right in front of it: it lunges its upper body forward and slashes both hands forward toward screen-left in a fast clawing strike, then pulls back to the starting pose. Its hands never rise above its head. It never turns toward the viewer and always stays in the same left-facing view. Each strike is fast and snappy, lasting well under a second. Between strikes it returns exactly to the original starting pose and holds it still for a moment. It performs three separate identical strikes, evenly spaced in time. The skin and clothes keep their original colors with no pink or magenta tint. The feet stay planted on the same spot during the attack. The character stays at exactly the same position and scale; only the limbs, head and body parts move, the body does not travel across the frame. The camera is locked off, with fixed framing and the entire body visible. Preserve the exact original face, eyes, clothing, body proportions, colors and hand-drawn 2D style of the input image. The background remains a flat, uniform solid magenta. Smooth, fluid, continuous motion at an even tempo. Crisp outlines and clear separate limbs, with no motion blur. No camera movement, zoom, rotation, character turning, sliding across the frame, extra limbs, extra fingers, morphing, text or new objects.",
        640,
        512,
        124
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "prompt": "A 2D cartoon zombie soldier performs a steady walking cycle in place, facing screen-left throughout. His left and right legs alternate naturally: one foot lifts and steps forward while the other foot pushes backward, then they switch. His bent arms swing slightly in time with his steps. He completes several even steps and returns to the starting pose. The character stays centered at the same position and scale. The camera is locked off, with fixed framing and the entire body visible. Preserve the exact original face, helmet, clothing, body proportions, colors and hand-drawn 2D style. The background remains a flat, uniform solid magenta. Crisp outlines and clear separate limbs, with no motion blur. No camera movement, zoom, rotation, character turning, sliding across the frame, extra limbs, morphing, text or new objects.",
        "width": 512,
        "height": 512,
        "length": 124
      }
